    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #319\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-83-implementation-audit-fixes-04-23-reject-thr_gczr63vyv2`.\n\nThe remote had advanced with a merge from `develop` since the last push; I fetched, rebased my code-review fix commit on top of it cleanly, re-ran the `chokePoint.test.ts` integration suite (20/20 passing) to confirm nothing broke, and pushed the result.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis push contains the code-review fix for PR #319: the relation-mutation test now also exercises `updateRelation` and `deleteRelation` (not just `createRelation`) once item A's database is archived, matching the coverage already present for the item-B-archived side. All three relation mutations are verified to reject with `403 database_archived` from either side of the pair.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
